Trio settings upload: attach the full settings to the Nightscout profile document.

Fork-only patch (see CLAUDE.md "Exception: settings upload patch" and
docs/trio-settings-upload.md for the payload contract). Applied by build_trio.yml
via `git apply ./patches/*`; guarded by .github/workflows/patch_guard.yml.
Read-only with respect to dosing: it only reads settings and adds one optional
field (`trioSettings`) to the profile document that Trio already uploads.

